Since April, people have told us their bookings land on the wrong day: a month flipped. By
4 October the desk had **412 reports**.

**Merged as one issue, but not one problem.** The parser reads dates month first, and our day-first
tenants write the day first. That is one cause. The same reports also hold a booking-v3 form hint
problem and a few one-day shifts.

<Callout kind="warn">
Split: [three problems, each with its own ticket](/kb/incidents/4471-three-problems). The queued parser
fix closes only the parser problem.
</Callout>

